<h1>Better connections.<br><em>Stronger systems.</em></h1>
<div class="hero-bottom"><div><p class="intro">I’m Ahmed Almadhoun. I study how transport networks shape access, opportunity, and the movement of goods.</p><p class="muted">From freight research to analytical practice, my work connects engineering questions with evidence that supports better decisions.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="#research">Explore my research <span>↘</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#experience">Professional background ↗</a></div></div><div class="hero-note"><span class="mini">CURRENTLY EXPLORING</span><p>What makes a freight<br>network truly accessible?</p><span class="mini">WARSAW UNIVERSITY OF TECHNOLOGY<br>FACULTY OF TRANSPORT</span></div></div>
